{"sectionId":"metabolism/glycolysis","items":[{"id":"metabolism--glycolysis-k001","sectionId":"metabolism/glycolysis","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"해당과정은 세포질에서 포도당 1분자를 피루브산 2분자로 전환하며 순 ATP 2개, NADH 2개를 생성한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--glycolysis-k002","sectionId":"metabolism/glycolysis","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"투자 단계에서 hexokinase/glucokinase와 PFK-1이 ATP를 소비하고, 회수 단계에서 phosphoglycerate kinase와 pyruvate kinase가 기질수준 인산화로 ATP를 생성한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--glycolysis-k003","sectionId":"metabolism/glycolysis","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"비가역적 핵심 단계는 hexokinase, PFK-1, pyruvate kinase이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--glycolysis-k004","sectionId":"metabolism/glycolysis","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"PFK-1은 ATP 및 citrate에 의해 억제되고 AMP와 fructose-2,6-bisphosphate에 의해 활성화된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--glycolysis-k005","sectionId":"metabolism/glycolysis","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"산소 공급과 미토콘드리아 산화가 충분하지 않을 때 젖산탈수소효소는 피루브산을 젖산으로 환원하며 NADH를 NAD⁺로 재산화한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--glycolysis-k006","sectionId":"metabolism/glycolysis","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"발효는 해당과정 외 추가 ATP를 만들지 않지만 NAD⁺를 재생한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--glycolysis-k007","sectionId":"metabolism/glycolysis","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"적혈구는 미토콘드리아가 없어 해당과정에 의존하며 2,3-BPG 우회로는 ATP 생성 단계를 우회하고 헤모글로빈 산소 친화도를 낮춘다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--glycolysis-k008","sectionId":"metabolism/glycolysis","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"해당 순수익: 2 ATP, 2 NADH, 2 pyruvate.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--glycolysis-k009","sectionId":"metabolism/glycolysis","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"PFK-1의 반응은 F6P→F1,6BP이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--glycolysis-k010","sectionId":"metabolism/glycolysis","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"발효의 핵심 역할은 NAD⁺ 재생이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--glycolysis-k011","sectionId":"metabolism/glycolysis","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"해당에서 만들어진 NADH가 젖산 생성에 소모되므로 0이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}